              "text": "او خیلی رک است و نظرش را میگوید. u kheyli rok ast va nazarash râ miguyad. She's very frank and says what she thinks."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Common in speech; also rok-o-râst 'straight out'."
