            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هیچکس حرف یک دروغگو را باور نمیکند. hichkas harf-e yek dorughgu râ bâvar nemikonad. Nobody believes a liar."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "dorugh 'lie' + gu 'saying' (stem of goftan). Plural dorughguhâ."
            }
          ]
        },
